      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Expired giveaway on every state deals page"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Hero “Summer's last pull. Fire up for the long weekend.” and “Win a $500+ Adventure Weekend! … August 27 through September 7” are still the lead on all seven /new-upcoming-deals/ pages. Fine print: “Contest runs 8/27/26 to 9/7/26."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Connecticut's drawing date is before the contest starts"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "CT fine print: “Drawing 8/11/26.” MI, MO, IL and NJ say 9/11/26. One pasted legal block, one wrong digit, in the state that regulates it."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Same SKU, same $35 reg, three promo depths"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Galactic Orange Yuzu 1:1 Gummies 300mg (POS SKU 79530692): St Louis $21 (“Flash Sale – 40% Off”), Chesterfield $24.50 (30%), Branson $24.50 (30%). St Louis and Branson also attach “20% Off Galactic 300mg Gummies”; Chesterfield doesn't."
    },
